  "description": "Aspire Huai Khwang is a large-scale residential development spanning over 5-3-69.6 Rai (approximately 2,369.6 sq.wa.), featuring 1,274 residential units and one commercial shop. The project offers a diverse range of living spaces, including Simplex and Triplex unit types, designed to cater to modern urban lifestyles. Residents enjoy an extensive suite of high-end facilities, such as a clubhouse, co-working space, theater, fitness center, and a sky pool with a jacuzzi, alongside lush gardens and social lounges. Strategically located near the MRT Huai Khwang station, the development provides excellent connectivity to major Bangkok landmarks including Central Rama 9, Fortune Town, and Terminal 21, as well as essential institutions like Praram 9 Hospital and the University of the Thai Chamber of Commerce.",
